schwung-kr106
=============

This module is the Ableton Move port of **Ultramaster KR-106**, a
Roland Juno-6/60/106 emulation by the Ultramaster Group:

  Karl LaRocca <kayrock@gmail.com>
  David Mansfield <dmansfield@gmail.com>
  2026 rewrite: Karl LaRocca
  https://github.com/kayrockscreenprinting/ultramaster_kr106

Distributed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (see LICENSE).
The Move build uses the JUCE-free DSP core only; the JUCE framework is
not included in or linked by this module.

Built for the Schwung framework by Charles Vestal (MIT licensed):
  https://github.com/charlesvestal/schwung
The schwung-hera module (GPL-3.0) served as the porting reference:
  https://github.com/charlesvestal/schwung-hera

